    {
      "id": "y21pj8z",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "5.4 Industry"
    },
    {
      "id": "shvy490",
      "type": "image",
      "imageId": "8wz6va5",
      "src": "/books/Guide/Himachal_Pradesh_CONSTABLE/images/image_8wz6va5.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "id": "gi5djnb",
      "type": "list",
      "items": [
        "Baddi-Barotiwala-Nalagarh (BBN) in Solan: Largest industrial hub of HP; major pharma cluster.",
        "Other industrial areas: Parwanoo (Solan), Gondpur/Mehatpur/Tahliwal (Una), Paonta Sahib (Sirmaur on Yamuna).",
        "Pharmaceutical sector: HP hosts hundreds of pharma units; Sun Pharma, Dr Reddy's, Cipla and others operate in BBN.",
        "HPIDC (HP Industrial Development Corporation): Develops and manages industrial estates.",
        "Cement industry: Ambuja Cement, ACC in Himachal; limestone resources in Bilaspur, Solan.",
        "Cottage industries: Kullu shawls, Chamba Rumal, Kinnauri handicrafts, Pahari woodcraft.",
        "Special package for HP industries: Central incentives given for investment in hill states.",
        "IT sector: HP has attracted some IT companies to Shimla and Solan though small-scale.",
        "Food processing: Fruit processing units (jam, juice, wine) growing in Shimla, Kullu, Kinnaur."
      ]
    },
